origin.ideaDescription=The idea for the app and its features comes from a human.\nIf you have more ideas for the app, you are very welcome to share them with me. 😊
origin.developmentDescription=The friendly robot (GitHub Copilot in this case) is extremely capable at development – and faster than I could ever be as a human.\nI look forward to watching “Data” (remember Star Trek?) grow over the coming years. 👍
origin.refinementDescription1=AI supports my programming skills (which only go so deep), but especially helps me implement things promptly. Not to forget: it also takes care of Git, test cases and translations for me, almost as an afterthought.
origin.refinementDescription2=In return, I know what I want the app to do and how a human will use and perceive it, visually and as a whole. A real human user test is essential, of course: checking everything once it has been built.
origin.refinementDescription3=Creative thinking meets technical implementation: I provide the idea, AI handles the code. Together we examine it from both perspectives until it feels right. As we Germans like to say: it could be worse. 😉
origin.ideaHint=Idea and requirements: human.
origin.developmentHint=AI-assisted development, guided and reviewed by a human.
